cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulator or its research record, please cite it as below."
title: "nfl_simulator: a deserve-to-win simulator for NFL games"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "dgrifka"
version: 1.4.0
date-released: "2026-09-02"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dgrifka/nfl_simulator"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Re-adjudicates one NFL game by neutralizing luck rather than replaying
  plays: each luck event's realized EPA is replaced by its expectation, and
  the coin flips are bootstrapped into a deserve-to-win distribution. Built
  on play-by-play and charting data from the nflverse project
  (https://github.com/nflverse), with full credit to its maintainers.
